{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000018_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000018_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:cbb46474036347f806bb341549febc3f3dcaa96c7ecaf9aa57a6dbf517a7717d", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 1, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "…Так…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000019_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000019_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:7dbedb3b3dc38d83d4fb7aa9ea145cd16db92b67f9317392acf5ace77845963c", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 2, "speaker": null, "translation": "Кёко-сан дала мне её, и я вроде убрал куда-то сюда.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000020_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000020_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8e11c32625a933a138ee854d9f695e210a15e6999685b75060e55b35db41a0ac", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 3, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Нашёл, нашёл.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000021_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000021_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:355c80522f0e37941e85eb9c9cee5fc9e60f77bd6b51923a115e33631c37fa77", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 4, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Так, какого она размера?", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000022_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000022_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:13130f6a253d370fe7ef6315fe164de380ff5c8552a4f89962c888bae414bcad", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 5, "speaker": null, "translation": "Перед зеркалом пробую прикинуть её размеры.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000023_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000023_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:91e8d9a97c4de5e1885d5aa9af9c7c305cb6af0360e0a7bd947aa78dfddf2f72", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 6, "speaker": null, "translation": "Мне она, конечно, мала, но…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000024_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000024_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4fc6b2cd33f189364dd7520bd835edbd708987b488797df985dba497162ffd37", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 7, "speaker": null, "translation": "Камомэ она вроде должна подойти.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000028_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000028_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e890955cdfab040d8a95d6f8f4f36660060774897bca466d8ed1a6a983d2b186", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 8, "speaker": "うみ", "translation": "О-они-тян?..", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000029_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000029_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a2b1d24c61be470bb15b04da68688b9b03681f0e425ed4228a54b550d55523c6", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 9, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Что?", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000033_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000033_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1bea96d385232141245dea2fa50c8f5eb041889d82e60eb80599db5915626d3d", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 10, "speaker": "うみ", "translation": "Я всё не могла понять… почему такая одежда лежит у они-тяна в комнате…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000036_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000036_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9c461581f7abb2a127ef77d737d042eb06d6942b31104ce08fbb04ffe342cb99", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 11, "speaker": "うみ", "translation": "Все загадки разгаданы!", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_humor_review"]}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000037_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000037_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ab35ca00ce751399ad065c6b35265624ba5eabbe6e1a8841944ec54d41a939e0", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 12, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Не то. Я же в неё даже по размеру не влезу.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000040_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000040_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4bff489db303311e60f3a0d8a1b9142fc233e63c019c22e2b9dd6b493510aece", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 13, "speaker": "うみ", "translation": "Истина всегда одна!", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_humor_review"]}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000041_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000041_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:c620d33f893abee0a2661d1bf06ea36450f797ab1c380a5d932b7558b562a37f", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 14, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Да нет же, я ведь…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000044_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000044_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ba0228c919d8d0b971255e8fe6385686279e3b245179ff8d6bcb9600ff52a00f", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 15, "speaker": "うみ", "translation": "Клянусь именем бабушки!", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_humor_review"]}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000047_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000047_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:cf1cac064ec2cda361f62654d1f848ad474401b0e49f6cbbeb3389bcdd6d26c3", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 16, "speaker": "うみ", "translation": "Ишь ты, болван, чёрт побери-и!", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_humor_review"]}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000048_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000048_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d8f5a0de23771825935f82813776674e7a58a68c1c4411b8996a54ce51bfd534", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 17, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Стой, Уми-тян! Ты всё смешала, а последнее вообще не оттуда!", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_humor_review"]}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000049_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000049_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:44f32b2295d031cdb5fef33e2b390ed55b500c3452f7d597e72f44e1d858991d", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 18, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Послушай. Я подарю это кое-кому из друзей.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000052_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000052_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:7bee66a964905d624e324394d9d5b3f804b788a2964f6c4dd70a12556ee231f8", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 19, "speaker": "うみ", "translation": "Кому-то из друзей?.. С таким же увлечением?", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000053_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000053_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6e761c11211a2bdbb3118ba9fa2e697d796293e3ecd731d7f3ef0689a823692e", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 20, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Во-первых, это вообще не моё увлечение.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000054_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000054_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:b74a1807bfede5fb59df4b816e38ea2046cc3e2d041bb77acd3989057fd74184", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 21, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Это просто подруга.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000057_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000057_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1f48f4367c5d2581da5f2e6d807cd98693840fcdefb5a0e769c19fcc8fda3fc7", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 22, "speaker": "うみ", "translation": "…Твоя девушка?", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0138_R000058_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000143_R000058_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:3bbe54b7bbbb32650a5797394cc87865e8c4293a2187b10331a2532ec04050d2", "file_id": "S0138", "scene_id": "SCN0113", "order": 23, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Нет.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": []}
